  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving living conditions in the 3 de Junio community, Cartagena</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the period 2014-16 CAFOD would like to support the Diocese of Cartagena to provide assistance to residents of the 3 de Junio community to help them to fulfil their basic needs more adequately.  The initial phase of the project will involve the project&#x2019;s design by partner staff and community members, where needs will be highlighted, and key needs to be addressed through the project will be agreed on.

The Diocese of Cartagena would like representatives from the community to form a community group which will disseminate information and learning to other residents and promote involvement in the project.  A youth group consisting of children and young people will also be established to carry out cultural activities related to issues or problems facing the community.  There will also be work with a women&#x2019;s group.</narrative>
  </description>
